    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/higbwm-ss/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=642945950142169714&sectionId=642945971499565681)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdeCx1bD_m_text","label":"ggdeCx1bD_m_text","default":"Here’s how it works"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLtGupNIMP_text","label":"ggLtGupNIMP_text","default":"<p>GemGut is a natural, multi-action formula designed to support your digestive system in real-life conditions—stress, irregular eating, and modern lifestyles. Instead of forcing quick fixes, it works with your body to gently reset, rebalance, and strengthen your gut over time.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0JWpHAK0Z_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg0JWpHAK0Z_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0946/3011/7697/files/Gemini_Generated_Image_78u0ju78u0ju78u0_1.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggY8BVKIUkg_text","label":"ggY8BVKIUkg_text","default":"<p>1</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLRy2r3xmE_text","label":"ggLRy2r3xmE_text","default":"We start by calming gut disruption"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkzsQP-6cI_text","label":"ggkzsQP-6cI_text","default":"<p>Your gut is constantly affected by daily stress, кофе, fast food, and irregular eating habits. These factors can irritate your digestive system, leading to bloating, discomfort, and sluggish digestion.</p><p>GemGut begins with soothing botanical extracts like ginger, chamomile, and aloe vera to calm inflammation and relax the digestive tract. This creates a more stable internal environment—an essential first step before any real gut repair can happen.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyJo6HucdM_text","label":"ggyJo6HucdM_text","default":"<p>2</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbBsaOwpML_text","label":"ggbBsaOwpML_text","default":"Then we reduce harmful bacteria"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpykt7jeL6_text","label":"ggpykt7jeL6_text","default":"<p>An imbalanced gut often means harmful bacteria have started to dominate. Instead of harsh elimination, GemGut uses natural prebiotic fibers to gently shift the ecosystem.</p><p>These fibers act as nourishment for beneficial bacteria while making it harder for harmful microbes to thrive. Over time, this helps rebalance your gut in a sustainable, non-aggressive way—without disrupting your body’s natural rhythm.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPe4IFMO-C_text","label":"ggPe4IFMO-C_text","default":"<p>3</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9Jjo8iK_k_text","label":"gg9Jjo8iK_k_text","default":"We reintroduce beneficial bacteria"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZhgT3pHrM_text","label":"ggZhgT3pHrM_text","default":"<p>With the gut environment improved, live probiotic cultures (Lactobacillus &amp; Bifidobacterium) are able to settle and begin restoring a healthy microbiome.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSAPKmYg9S_text","label":"ggSAPKmYg9S_text","default":"<p>4</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_DbALGREo_text","label":"gg_DbALGREo_text","default":"Your digestion starts working efficiently again"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxAxXA16EV_text","label":"ggxAxXA16EV_text","default":"<p>Plant-based enzymes and peppermint support faster breakdown of food, reducing bloating, heaviness, and post-meal discomfort—often within 30–60 minutes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfR1tG16YS_text","label":"ggfR1tG16YS_text","default":"<p>5</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj1A4yJybj_text","label":"ggj1A4yJybj_text","default":"Your gut stays balanced and resilient"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSfX8Euaw0_text","label":"ggSfX8Euaw0_text","default":"<p>With consistent use, your gut becomes more stable, better at handling stress, and more efficient at absorbing nutrients—helping you feel lighter, more energized, and in control every day.</p>"}],
